  "current_difference": "36 of38 files byte-identical. input_controller.js only adds composer timing instrumentation. Inbox footer removes campaign preview controller, adds contact_id to template-library GET, and changes note lazy-loading/loading partial; composition, toolbar and channel/context contracts retained. Exact diffs inspected. No app/config update or new Inbox capture.",
  "contracts": [
    "Toolbar tools are enabled by technology, compose include/exclude options and conversation window; contexts are not interchangeable",
    "Template Message and Email are distinct editors; SMS actual gateways use Message.plain_text",
    "Native formatting/Link contracts and actual shortcut evidence retained from #325 without re-execution",
    "URL popup is static, Add/Enter creates Link before final template/message save; no dynamic name control",
    "Tags menu uses default profile/business fields or conversation-specific allowed names; a campaign menu does not promise identical Inbox options",
    "Valid profile/custom-property tokens use a fallback; object tokens require the actual flow context and are not all listed in the menu",
    "Locations require channel and compose support; current playbook message form explicitly excludes location even though WhatsApp is its technology",
    "Draft/editor preview does not establish approval, permission, delivery, click or attributed sale"
  ],
  "operations": "Read-only primary sources and reuse of approved P3 native assets; no application/DB/UI/locale/provider/fixture/example/API/worker action."
}
